        "description": "Acne Studios is a multidisciplinary luxury fashion house based in Stockholm that has grown from its origins in denim into a global leader in contemporary design. The brand is celebrated for its unique approach to fashion, which integrates art, photography, and high-quality publishing into its core operations. Offering a range of ready-to-wear apparel and accessories, the brand appeals to a sophisticated, creatively-minded audience. Its market positioning balances high-end luxury with an avant-garde edge, consistently pushing boundaries in aesthetics and design.",
